      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115683,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 579,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 750,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Subtype(s)",
    "headingPosition": 5,
    "headingid": 580,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115684,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 580,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>None</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 751,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Localization",
    "headingPosition": 6,
    "headingid": 581,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115685,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 581,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Rare examples of STUMP have been reported in the sinonasal tract {12653572; 27879303}, but leiomyoma and leiomyosarcoma are much more common {2242259; 29270859}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 752,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Clinical features",
    "headingPosition": 7,
    "headingid": 582,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115686,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 582,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Sinonasal tumours present with nasal obstruction and facial pain.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 753,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Epidemiology",
    "headingPosition": 8,
    "headingid": 583,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115687,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 583,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Epidemiological data are limited to single case reports. Patients with STUMP are aged 20&ndash;44&nbsp;years, with both sexes affected {12653572; 27879303}.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 754,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Etiology",
    "headingPosition": 9,
    "headingid": 584,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115688,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 584,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 755,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Pathogenesis",
    "headingPosition": 10,
    "headingid": 585,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115689,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 585,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Unknown</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 762,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Macroscopic appearance",
    "headingPosition": 11,
    "headingid": 592,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115690,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 592,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>STUMPs typically form an ulcerated submucosal mass with a fleshy, pale-tan appearance.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 756,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Histopathology",
    "headingPosition": 12,
    "headingid": 586,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115691,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 586,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>These tumours form interlacing fascicles and bundles of smooth muscle cells with blunt-ended nuclei and ample eosinophilic cytoplasm, show slightly increased cellularity, mild to moderate pleomorphism, and a mitotic count of &le;&nbsp;4&nbsp;mitoses/2&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup> {12653572; 27879303}. Tumour cells blend with the musculature of the tunica media of vessels {12653572}. Erosion or invasion of surrounding bone or cartilage may be present {12653572}. Isolated pleomorphism is generally seen in symplastic leiomyoma {12401830}.</p>\r\n<p>Immunocytochemistry is positive for SMA, MSA, and desmin, with no nuclear expression of &beta;-catenin, HMB45, SOX10, S100, or keratins {27137987}.</p>\r\n<p>The differential diagnosis includes leiomyoma, leiomyosarcoma, biphenotypic sinonasal sarcoma, glomangiopericytoma, peripheral nerve sheath tumour, perivascular epithelioid cell tumour (PEComa), and meningioma. The modest cellularity, moderate pleomorphism, and lower mitotic count are usually sufficient to make the distinction from sarcoma.</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 757,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Cytology",
    "headingPosition": 13,
    "headingid": 587,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115692,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 587,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 758,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Diagnostic molecular pathology",
    "headingPosition": 14,
    "headingid": 588,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115693,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 588,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not clinically relevant</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 761,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Essential and desirable diagnostic criteria",
    "headingPosition": 15,
    "headingid": 591,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115694,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 591,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p><em>Essential:</em> a smooth muscle tumour with mild to moderate pleomorphism, increased cellularity, and a mitotic count of &le;&nbsp;4&nbsp;mitoses/2&nbsp;mm<sup>2</sup>; no tumour necrosis.</p>\r\n<p><em>Desirable:</em> desmin, SMA, and/or caldesmon (in selected cases).</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 759,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Staging",
    "headingPosition": 16,
    "headingid": 589,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115695,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 589,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>Not performed</p>\r\n",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  },
  {
    "pkheadingid": 760,
    "bookid": 52,
    "headingType": 2,
    "headingTitle": "Prognosis and prediction",
    "headingPosition": 17,
    "headingid": 590,
    "contributions": [
      {
        "pkcontributionId": 115696,
        "bookId": 52,
        "chapterId": 339,
        "headingId": 590,
        "headingText": "\r\n<p>STUMPs are more likely than leiomyomas to recur locally {12653572; 27879303}.</p>",
        "timestamp": "2023-10-02T11:07:27"
      }
    ],
    "booknotes": [],
    "numberofBooknote": 0
  }
]